---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { company, contact } from '../../lib/site-data';
import { yol } from '../../i18n';

const guncelleme = '21 September 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Eymen Reklam collects, uses and protects personal data, and your rights under Turkish data protection law (KVKK)."
  lang="en"
  sayfa="gizlilik"
>

  <section class="bg-koyu-900 pt-32 pb-12 md:pt-40 md:pb-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-koyu-400">Last updated: {guncelleme}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="bg-eymen-50 border border-eymen-200 rounded-xl p-5 mb-10 text-sm text-koyu-700">
        This is an English summary prepared for readers outside Turkey. Personal data is processed under Turkish
        Law No. 6698 on the Protection of Personal Data (KVKK), and the
        <a href={yol('tr', 'gizlilik')} class="text-eymen-700 underline">Turkish version of this policy</a>
        is the legally binding text.
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-10">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-koyu-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-koyu-100">1. Data Controller</h2>
          <div class="text-koyu-600 leading-relaxed space-y-2">
            <p>{company.fullName}</p>
            <p>Registered office: {contact.addressOffice}</p>
            <p>Production facility: {contact.address}</p>
            <p>Email: <a href={contact.emailHref} class="text-eymen-600 hover:text-eymen-700">{contact.email}</a> · Phone: +90 216 379 07 08</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-koyu-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-koyu-100">2. Data We Process</h2>
          <div class="text-koyu-600 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-koyu-900 mb-2">a) Through the quote and contact forms</h3>
              <p>Name, company name, job title, phone number, email address, country, project location and the details you write about your project.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-koyu-900 mb-2">b) Automatically while you use the site</h3>
              <p>IP address, browser and device information, pages visited and the time of the visit, collected through Google Analytics and Vercel Analytics.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-koyu-900 mb-2">c) By phone and WhatsApp</h3>
              <p>Your phone number and the content of the messages you send us.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-koyu-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-koyu-100">3. Purposes</h2>
          <ul class="text-koyu-600 leading-relaxed list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5">
            <li>Preparing and sending you a quotation</li>
            <li>Planning, producing and installing the work you order</li>
            <li>Meeting our legal and accounting obligations</li>
            <li>Understanding how the website is used and improving it</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-koyu-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-koyu-100">4. Legal Basis</h2>
          <p class="text-koyu-600 leading-relaxed">
            Data is processed under Article 5 of the KVKK: because it is necessary for entering into or performing
            a contract, because we have a legal obligation, and on the basis of our legitimate interests in running
            and improving our business.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-koyu-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-koyu-100">5. Transfers, Including Outside Turkey</h2>
          <p class="text-koyu-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            We do not sell your data or share it for marketing purposes. It is shared only with the service
            providers that make the website and our correspondence work:
          </p>
          <ul class="text-koyu-600 leading-relaxed list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5">
            <li><strong>Web3Forms</strong> — delivers form submissions to our email</li>
            <li><strong>Vercel</strong> — website hosting and traffic analytics</li>
            <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> — anonymised visit statistics</li>
            <li><strong>WhatsApp (Meta)</strong> — if you choose to contact us that way</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-koyu-600 leading-relaxed mt-4">
            Some of these providers hold data on servers outside Turkey. Where required we also share data with
            our accountants and with public authorities when the law obliges us to.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-koyu-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-koyu-100">6. Retention</h2>
          <p class="text-koyu-600 leading-relaxed">
            Quote requests are kept for as long as the commercial relationship requires, and records with an
            accounting or legal dimension for the periods set out in Turkish law (generally ten years). Analytics
            data is kept for the retention period of the relevant platform.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-koyu-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-koyu-100">7. Your Rights</h2>
          <p class="text-koyu-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Under Article 11 of the KVKK you have the right to:</p>
          <ul class="text-koyu-600 leading-relaxed list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5">
            <li>Learn whether we process your personal data, and request information if we do</li>
            <li>Learn the purpose of the processing and whether the data is used accordingly</li>
            <li>Know the third parties, in Turkey or abroad, to whom the data has been transferred</li>
            <li>Ask for incomplete or inaccurate data to be corrected</li>
            <li>Ask for the data to be erased or destroyed</li>
            <li>Object to a result produced solely by automated analysis</li>
            <li>Claim compensation for damage caused by unlawful processing</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-koyu-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-koyu-100">8. How to Apply</h2>
          <p class="text-koyu-600 leading-relaxed">
            Write to <a href={contact.emailHref} class="text-eymen-600 hover:text-eymen-700">{contact.email}</a>,
            or send a signed written application to our registered office at {contact.addressOffice}. We respond
            within 30 days at the latest.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-koyu-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-koyu-100">9. Security</h2>
          <p class="text-koyu-600 leading-relaxed">
            The site is served over HTTPS. Form data is transmitted encrypted, access to our systems is limited to
            authorised staff, and we take the technical and administrative measures required by the KVKK.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-koyu-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-koyu-100">10. Changes</h2>
          <p class="text-koyu-600 leading-relaxed">
            We may update this policy. The current version is always the one published on this page, with its date
            of last update shown at the top.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-koyu-900 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Any questions?</h2>
          <p class="text-koyu-400 mb-5">Write to us about anything in this policy and we will answer.</p>
          <a href={contact.emailHref} class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-eymen-500 hover:bg-eymen-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold transition-colors">
            {contact.email}
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
